{"title":"Scroll Ward","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Ogre Youth, Ice Troll Brute, Stonegaze Cultist</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      <p><b>Teaches</b> Ward, a level-3 Restoration spell. Needs 30 Intellect and Restoration skill 15 to learn and to cast.</p><p><b>Drops from any monster that casts spells, level 18+.</b></p><ul class=\"wp-list\">\n          <li>Restoration scrolls come from any caster, whatever school it casts.</li>\n          <li>The monster’s level picks the spell level: <b>8+</b> drops level-2 scrolls, <b>18+</b> level-3 and <b>30+</b> level-4.</li>\n          </ul>\n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ice-troll-brute\" title=\"Ice Troll Brute - dropped it in 1 of 4 looted corpses (1/4)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/89113af10356d687e501.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ice Troll Brute</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/4<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"stonegaze-cultist\" title=\"Stonegaze Cultist - dropped it in 1 of 8 looted corpses (1/8)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/93d5e7789a6f650fc2bd.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Stonegaze Cultist</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/8<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-youth\" title=\"Ogre Youth - dropped it in 1 of 190 looted corpses (1/190)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/8fe05349771531a800b3.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogre Youth</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/190<br>×1</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"scroll-ward\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/d65310365631cac7ee0b.svg\" alt=\"Scroll Ward\"></div><h3>Scroll Ward</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Dropped by</th><td>3 monsters</td></tr>\n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Last seen</th><td>10/29/2026, 9:09:23 PM</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}